<div class="panel">
  <div class="topline">
    <h1>🔬 {{ t('Signal Lab', '信号实验室') }}</h1>
    <span class="muted sm">{{ t('Every signal, and whether it actually survives validation',
                                '每个信号，以及它是否真正通过验证') }}</span>
  </div>
  <p class="lead" style="margin:10px 0 0">{{ t(
     "What separates a dashboard from a model is honest validation. Every signal here goes "
     "through the same battery before it earns a place: rank-IC, a Newey-West (HAC) t-stat that "
     "respects overlapping windows, a Benjamini-Hochberg FDR q that controls for trying many "
     "ideas, and a Deflated Sharpe that haircuts for the same data-snooping. The point of this "
     "page is the graveyard: the signals we measured and refused to ship.",
     "把仪表盘和模型区分开的，是诚实的验证。这里每个信号在获得位置前都经过同一套检验："
     "秩相关 IC、尊重重叠窗口的 Newey-West (HAC) t 值、控制多重尝试的 Benjamini-Hochberg FDR q，"
     "以及为同样的数据窥探打折的去偏夏普 (DSR)。本页的重点是“信号墓地”：那些我们测量后拒绝上线的信号。") }}</p>
  <div class="chips">
    <span class="chip"><span class="dot d-scored"></span><b>{{ summary.scored }}</b> {{ t('scored','已计分') }}</span>
    <span class="chip"><span class="dot d-confirmer"></span><b>{{ summary.confirmer }}</b> {{ t('confirmer','确认项') }}</span>
    <span class="chip"><span class="dot d-display"></span><b>{{ summary.display }}</b> {{ t('display-only','仅展示') }}</span>
    <span class="chip"><span class="dot d-killed"></span><b>{{ summary.killed }}</b> {{ t('killed (NO-GO)','已否决') }}</span>
    <span class="chip"><span class="dot d-pending"></span><b>{{ summary.pending }}</b> {{ t('pending','待接入') }}</span>
    {% if summary.factor_total %}
    <span class="chip {{ 'grave' if summary.factor_survivors == 0 }}">🧮 <b>{{ summary.factor_survivors }}</b>/{{ summary.factor_total }}
      {{ t('cross-sectional factors survive FDR','横截面因子通过 FDR') }}</span>
    {% endif %}
  </div>
</div>

{% if factor_rows %}
{% set surv = factor_survivors or [] %}
{% set snames = [] %}
{% for s in surv %}{% set _ = snames.append(s.name ~ ' (' ~ ('+' if (s.ic or 0) > 0 else '−') ~ ')') %}{% endfor %}
<div class="panel {{ 'grave' if not surv }}">
  <div class="tierhead">
    <h2>🧮 {{ t('US equity factor cross-section — leak-free, point-in-time','美股因子横截面 — 无泄漏、时点') }}</h2>
    <span class="bl">{{ t(
      'The honest centerpiece. Quarterly cross-sectional rank-IC of each factor z-score vs the '
      ~ (factor_meta.horizon_d or 63) ~ 'd forward return, fully point-in-time (EDGAR + prices '
      'truncated to as-of). '
      ~ ('After the PIT fix, NONE survive Benjamini-Hochberg FDR at 10% — exactly the cost of refusing to look ahead.'
         if not surv else
         ('Only ' ~ (snames|join(', ')) ~ ' survive BH-FDR at 10% — and mind the IC sign: a survivor with a NEGATIVE IC is anti-predictive, not tradeable.')),
      '诚实的核心。每个因子 z 分对 ' ~ (factor_meta.horizon_d or 63) ~ '日前瞻收益的季度横截面秩相关 IC，完全时点（EDGAR 与价格截断至当时）。'
      ~ ('时点修正后，无一通过 10% 的 Benjamini-Hochberg FDR — 这正是拒绝前视的代价。'
         if not surv else
         ('仅 ' ~ (snames|join(', ')) ~ ' 通过 10% 的 BH-FDR — 注意 IC 符号：负 IC 的“通过者”是反预测，不可交易。'))) }}</span>
  </div>
  <div class="scroll"><table>
    <thead><tr>
      <th>{{ t('Factor','因子') }}</th>
      <th class="r">{{ t('mean IC','平均 IC') }}{{ help('Cross-sectional rank correlation of the factor z-score with the forward return, averaged over rebalances. Judge vs ~0.','因子 z 分与前瞻收益的横截面秩相关，按调仓平均。对比 ~0 判断。') }}</th>
      <th class="r">{{ t('IC-IR','IC 信息比') }}</th>
      <th class="r">{{ t('HAC t','HAC t') }}{{ help('Newey-West t-stat of the IC series — corrects for the autocorrelation that overlapping forward windows create. |t|>~2 is the usual bar.','IC 序列的 Newey-West t 值，校正重叠前瞻窗口造成的自相关。通常门槛 |t|>~2。') }}</th>
      <th class="r">{{ t('FDR q','FDR q') }}{{ help('Benjamini-Hochberg q across the whole factor panel — the false-discovery rate if you call this factor real. <0.10 = survives.','整组因子的 Benjamini-Hochberg q — 若判定该因子为真的错误发现率。<0.10 = 通过。') }}</th>
      <th class="r">{{ t('hit','命中') }}</th>
      <th class="r">n</th>
      <th class="r">{{ t('survives?','通过？') }}</th>
    </tr></thead>
    <tbody>
    {% for r in factor_rows %}
      <tr>
        <td class="sig">{{ t(r.name, r.name_zh) }}</td>
        <td class="r {{ 'pos' if (r.ic or 0) > 0 else 'neg' }}">{{ num(r.ic, 4, plus=True) }}</td>
        <td class="r">{{ num(r.ic_ir, 3, plus=True) }}</td>
        <td class="r">{{ num(r.t_hac, 2, plus=True) }}</td>
        <td class="r">{{ num(r.q_fdr, 3) }}</td>
        <td class="r">{{ pct(r.hit) }}</td>
        <td class="r">{{ r.n if r.n is not none else '—' }}</td>
        <td class="r">{% if r.survives %}<span class="yes">✓</span>{% else %}<span class="no">✗</span>{% endif %}</td>
      </tr>
    {% endfor %}
    </tbody>
  </table></div>
  {% if factor_meta.collinearity %}
  <p class="extra" style="margin-top:8px">{{ t(
    'Collinearity: mean |corr| ' ~ factor_meta.collinearity.mean_abs_corr_raw ~ ' raw → '
    ~ factor_meta.collinearity.mean_abs_corr_orth ~ ' after Löwdin orthogonalisation. '
    ~ ('Span ' ~ factor_meta.span ~ ' · ' ~ factor_meta.rebalances ~ ' rebalances · ~'
       ~ factor_meta.median_universe ~ ' names.'),
    '共线性：平均 |corr| ' ~ factor_meta.collinearity.mean_abs_corr_raw ~ ' 原始 → '
    ~ factor_meta.collinearity.mean_abs_corr_orth ~ ' 经 Löwdin 正交化后。'
    ~ ('区间 ' ~ factor_meta.span ~ ' · ' ~ factor_meta.rebalances ~ ' 次调仓 · ~'
       ~ factor_meta.median_universe ~ ' 只。')) }}</p>
  {% endif %}
</div>
{% endif %}

{% for tier in tiers %}
<div class="panel {{ 'win' if tier.key=='scored' else ('grave' if tier.key=='killed') }}">
  <div class="tierhead">
    <span class="dot d-{{ tier.key }}" style="align-self:center"></span>
    <h2>{{ t(tier.label, tier.label_zh) }} · {{ tier.count }}</h2>
    <span class="bl">{{ t(tier.blurb, tier.blurb_zh) }}</span>
  </div>
  <div class="scroll"><table>
    <thead><tr>
      <th>{{ t('Signal','信号') }}</th>
      <th class="r">IC</th>
      <th class="r">HAC t</th>
      <th class="r">FDR q</th>
      <th class="r">DSR{{ help('Deflated Sharpe (López de Prado): probability the true Sharpe > 0 after haircutting for the number of trials, skew and kurtosis. >0.90 is our bar.','去偏夏普（López de Prado）：在按试验次数、偏度与峰度打折后，真实夏普 >0 的概率。门槛 >0.90。') }}</th>
      <th class="r">{{ t('Sharpe','夏普') }}</th>
      <th class="r">{{ t('hit','命中') }}</th>
      <th class="r">n</th>
      <th>{{ t('Verdict','结论') }}</th>
      <th>{{ t('Why','原因') }}</th>
    </tr></thead>
    <tbody>
    {% for r in tier.rows %}
      <tr>
        <td>
          <div class="sig">{{ t(r.name, r.name_zh) }}
            {% if r.fdr_survivor %}<span class="yes" title="survives FDR">✓FDR</span>{% endif %}</div>
          <div class="mkt">{{ r.market }}{% if r.horizon %} · {{ r.horizon }}{% endif %}{% if r.wired %} · {{ r.wired }}{% endif %}</div>
          {% if r.extra %}<div class="extra">{% for lbl, val in r.extra %}{{ lbl }} {{ val }}{% if not loop.last %} · {% endif %}{% endfor %}</div>{% endif %}
        </td>
        <td class="r {{ 'pos' if (r.ic or 0) > 0 else ('neg' if r.ic is not none and r.ic < 0) }}">{{ num(r.ic, 4, plus=True) }}</td>
        <td class="r">{{ num(r.t_hac, 2, plus=True) }}</td>
        <td class="r {{ 'yes' if (r.q_fdr is not none and r.q_fdr < 0.10) }}">{{ num(r.q_fdr, 3) }}</td>
        <td class="r {{ 'yes' if (r.dsr is not none and r.dsr >= 0.90) else ('neg' if r.dsr is not none) }}">{{ num(r.dsr, 3) }}</td>
        <td class="r {{ 'pos' if (r.sharpe or 0) > 0 else ('neg' if r.sharpe is not none and r.sharpe < 0) }}">{{ num(r.sharpe, 2, plus=True) }}</td>
        <td class="r">{{ pct(r.hit) }}</td>
        <td class="r">{{ r.n if r.n is not none else '—' }}</td>
        <td><span class="pill v-{{ tier.key }}">{{ t(tier.verdict_word, tier.verdict_word_zh) }}</span></td>
        <td style="max-width:34ch">
          <span class="muted sm">{{ t(r.why[:120] ~ ('…' if r.why|length > 120 else ''),
                                      r.why_zh[:80] ~ ('…' if r.why_zh|length > 80 else '')) }}</span>
          {{ help(r.why ~ '  [' ~ r.source ~ ']', r.why_zh ~ '  [' ~ r.source ~ ']') }}
          <div class="src">{{ r.source }}</div>
        </td>
      </tr>
    {% endfor %}
    </tbody>
  </table></div>
</div>
{% endfor %}

<div class="panel">
  <details class="method">
    <summary>{{ t('How to read this page — the metrics, in plain language','如何阅读本页 — 指标的通俗解释') }}</summary>
    <dl>
      <dt>{{ t('Information Coefficient (IC)','信息系数 (IC)') }}</dt>
      <dd>{{ t('The cross-sectional rank correlation between a signal and the forward return. ~0 means no edge; an IC of 0.03 is a real, if modest, equity-factor edge.','信号与前瞻收益的横截面秩相关。~0 表示无边际；IC 0.03 已是真实但温和的股票因子边际。') }}</dd>
      <dt>{{ t('Newey-West (HAC) t-stat','Newey-West (HAC) t 值') }}</dt>
      <dd>{{ t('Is the average IC distinguishable from zero, AFTER correcting for the autocorrelation that overlapping forward windows create? Naive t-stats overstate significance here.','在校正重叠前瞻窗口造成的自相关后，平均 IC 是否显著不为零？朴素 t 值在此会高估显著性。') }}</dd>
      <dt>{{ t('Benjamini-Hochberg FDR q','Benjamini-Hochberg FDR q') }}</dt>
      <dd>{{ t('If you test many ideas, some will look good by luck. The FDR q controls the false-discovery rate across the whole panel. q<0.10 = survives. Most of our factors do NOT — and we show it.','若测试很多想法，总有些靠运气好看。FDR q 控制整组的错误发现率。q<0.10 = 通过。我们多数因子并未通过 — 我们如实展示。') }}</dd>
      <dt>{{ t('Deflated Sharpe (DSR)','去偏夏普 (DSR)') }}</dt>
      <dd>{{ t('A Sharpe ratio haircut for the number of strategies tried, plus return skew/kurtosis (López de Prado). It is the probability the true Sharpe is positive. Our bar is 0.90 — a backtest Sharpe that looks great but has DSR<0.90 is treated as luck.','按尝试的策略数量及收益偏度/峰度对夏普打折（López de Prado）。它是真实夏普为正的概率。门槛 0.90 — 回测夏普好看但 DSR<0.90 的，按运气处理。') }}</dd>
      <dt>{{ t('Point-in-time (leak-free)','时点（无泄漏）') }}</dt>
      <dd>{{ t('Fundamentals are stamped at period-end + reporting lag; index membership is reconstructed as it was on each date; indicators are shifted so a backtest only ever sees what was knowable then. This is why the spreads are honestly weaker than a naive backtest.','基本面以“期末+披露滞后”打戳；指数成分按当日实际重建；指标移位，使回测只看到当时可知的信息。这正是价差诚实地弱于朴素回测的原因。') }}</dd>
    </dl>
  </details>
</div>

<div class="panel">
  <p class="muted sm" style="margin:0">{{ t(
     'Validation toolkit: engine/validation.py (deflated Sharpe, purged k-fold + embargo, block '
     'bootstrap, Newey-West HAC, Benjamini-Hochberg FDR, Brier/Platt calibration, cost-aware '
     'backtest). Verdicts are quoted from the named reports in reports/. The factor cross-section '
     'reads live from data/edgar/ic_scorecard.json. See also the ',
     '验证工具：engine/validation.py（去偏夏普、净化 k 折+隔离、分块自助、Newey-West HAC、'
     'Benjamini-Hochberg FDR、Brier/Platt 校准、含成本回测）。结论引自 reports/ 中具名报告；'
     '因子横截面实时读取 data/edgar/ic_scorecard.json。另见 ') }}<a href="validation_timeline.html" style="color:var(--link)">{{ t('regime validation timeline','机制验证时间线') }}</a>{{ t('.','。') }}</p>
  <p class="src" style="margin:8px 0 0">
    {{ t('data span','数据区间') }} {{ factor_meta.span or '—' }} ·
    {{ t('dashboard updated','仪表盘更新') }} {{ generated_utc }} UTC ·
    {{ t('rendered','生成') }} {{ generated_utc }} UTC</p>
</div>

<script src="theme.js"></script>
</body>
</html>
